        "ggvo2k37QPA_text": "<p><strong>What is it?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Pure Shilajit Resin® are a pure, lab-tested, and natural solution for men to maintain peak physical, mental, and sexual health.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How does it help?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our Shilajit are proven to boost testosterone levels, improve sexual health, build muscle mass, increase energy and stamina, enhance mental focus and clarity, cleanse and detoxify the body, strengthen the immune system, and reduce stress and anxiety.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How To Take It?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We recommend 1 tea spoon per day for 5-6 days per week. Results may vary, but most men see improvement in overall health and energy levels within 2-4 weeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Is your libido playing hide and seek or find yourself constantly tired?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our Wellness Nest® Pure Shilajit Resin is proven to improve overall health &amp; energy levels.</p>"
      }
