    "gp_section_555044808214840400": {
      "type": "gp-section-555044808214840400",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "81462329aecc3e300ce704f893dd29cf60e30ec97aa51ceb0cf510a6fac16c74_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gWJnunfrraOLA_text": "<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></p>",
        "gAlkuZfxVZuEq_childItem_0": "<p><strong>How many Shilajit do I take per day?</strong></p>",
        "gAlkuZfxVZuEq_childItem_1": "<p><strong>When will I feel something?</strong></p>",
        "gAlkuZfxVZuEq_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Where is our Shilajit extracted from?</strong></p>",
        "gAlkuZfxVZuEq_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Does it have any side effects?</strong></p>",
        "gAlkuZfxVZuEq_childItem_4": "<p><strong>Can I take this with other supplements? What about medications?</strong></p>",
        "gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l201b643a78_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,253,250,0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">We recommend 1 tea spoon per day for 5-6 days per week.</span></p>",
        "ggCd5EYmfck_text": "<p>It varies person to person.</p><p>Some people start seeing improvement in overall health &amp; energy levels in as little as 2 weeks.</p><p>Majority see results after 4 weeks.</p>",
        "gaccordion-item-body-text-i2lf7ac59bd44_text": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">Our Shilajit is harvested in Himalayan region above 17,000 feet.</span></p>",
        "gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l663244236a_text": "<p>If taken in the recommended dosage sizes, there are 0 side effects.</p><p>However, if taken in large doses, it can cause nausea, vomiting, and diarrhea.</p>",
        "gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l8eed2f68bb_text": "<p>Our Shilajit Resin are safe to take with other supplements.</p><p>There are no known contraindications with our Shilajit Resin and any over the counter or prescription medications, though we encourage you to double check with your physician before adding our product to your regimen.</p>"
      }
    },
