        "ggNRcCEa3Wu_text": "<p>✔︎ Boosts Energy and Stamina</p>",
        "ggWzj6lO1Ft_text": "<p>✔︎ Proven &amp; Backed by Science</p>",
        "ggQUS_bDTgT_text": "<p>✔︎ Cleanses and Detoxifies</p>",
        "ggYWMKRJcqG_text": "<p>✔︎ Reduces Stress And Anxiety</p>",
