        "ggWFSWYvnSO_childItem_4": "<p><strong>🌱 Mental Focus &amp; Clarity</strong></p>",
        "ggWFSWYvnSO_childItem_5": "<p><strong>🌱 Cleanses and Detoxifies</strong></p>",
        "ggWFSWYvnSO_childItem_6": "<p><strong>🌱 Strengthens Immune System</strong></p>",
        "ggWFSWYvnSO_childItem_7": "<p><strong>🌱 Reduces Stress and Anxiety</strong></p>",
        "gg293ajo6tJ_text": "<p>In a clinical trial, male participants aged 45 to 55 were split into two groups: one received a 250 mg dose of purified Shilajit twice daily, while the other received a placebo.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After 30 days, those taking purified Shilajit exhibited significantly increased testosterone levels compared to the placebo group.</p>",
        "ggTxUny4W86_text": "<p>Shilajit works by increasing blood flow and reducing stress, which can has a positive impact on sexual performance and libido.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit also helps to balance hormones and improve energy levels, which are important factors for sexual health and function.</p>",
        "gg7koyRGVO6_text": "<p>Shilajit is considered one of the staple bodybuilding supplements. It is a natural supplement with no side effects to enhance endurance and build muscle mass.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It provides strength to the body and helps to gain muscle mass. It is a great post or pre-workout potent health supplement</p>",
        "gg5m0CNsJ7q_text": "<p>Shilajit has been used for centuries to boost energy and stamina.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It works by increasing the production of ATP, a molecule that provides energy to cells.</p>",
        "ggcwrqUFTWL_text": "<p>Shilajit has been shown to have neuroprotective effects, meaning they can help protect and support the health of the brain and nervous system.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It has been shown to improve learning and memory.</p>",
        "ggxleWr-cvL_text": "<p>Shilajit initiates gentle detoxification throughout the body, helping to purify the blood, remove toxins, and maintain a healthy weight.</p>",
        "ggiIcCorfmZ_text": "<p>It contains vitamins, minerals, and Fulvic Acid that have anti-oxidants to cleanse the body and improve the immune system.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit is one supplement that is natural and has anti-bacterial properties to fight free radicals and strengthens immunity.</p>",
        "ggVPAHTVnd9_text": "<p>One of the best shilajit health benefits includes aiding in increasing dopamine secretion in your brain. This majorly helps lessen your anxiety and stress levels.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As it contains high levels of magnesium and potassium, pure shilajit resin has a calming effect on your body that in turn helps with lowering your stress.</p>"
      }
